From f7792646fef8a62254b99dd69db98556960cddfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 11:19:07 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] skippy: add DiffusionGemma system-one reads

Expose a narrow native operation that prefills a DiffusionGemma prompt, performs one zero-self-conditioning canvas read, and returns normalized probabilities over caller-declared label tokens.

Co-authored-by: Michael Neale <14976+michaelneale@users.noreply.github.com>

Signed-off-by: Michael Neale <14976+michaelneale@users.noreply.github.com>
